Usage:
  trails COMMAND [options]

You must specify a command:

  new          Create a new Trails application. "trails new my_app" creates a
               new application called MyApp in "./my_app"
  plugin new   Create a new Trails railtie or engine

All commands can be run with -h (or --help) for more information.

Inside a Trails application directory, some common commands are:

  console      Start the Trails console
  server       Start the Trails server
  test         Run tests except system tests
